OL,3,GNEWSAGiant sun installation to light up
OL,4,Amarket hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA large art installation respresenting
OL,7,Fthe sun will light up an East Yorkshire
OL,8,Fmarket hall.
OL,10,FHelios, which was created by artist
OL,11,FLuke Jerram, will be displayed at Goole
OL,12,FMarket Hall from 25 September to 5
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FThe touring artwork, named after the
OL,16,Fancient Greek mythological god who
OL,17,Fpersonified the sun, was made using
OL,18,Fmore than 400,000 high-resolution
OL,19,Fphotographs of the sun's surface and
OL,20,Fobservational data from Nasa.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
