OL,3,GNEWSAGiant sun installation to light up
OL,4,Amarket hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Nick Coultish, East Riding
OL,7,Fof Yorkshire Council's cabinet member
OL,8,Ffor culture, leisure and tourism, said:
OL,9,F"We're absolutely delighted to be
OL,10,Fbringing Helios to Goole Market Hall as
OL,11,Fpart of the Goole 200 programme of
OL,12,Fevents planned to mark our town's
OL,13,Fbicentenary year."
